    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Eunice Kariuki has returned to the Aga Khan University as a clinical instructor, just a few months after earning her Master of Advanced Practice Nursing (Msc APN) degree. Her journey from student to clinical instructor at the School of Nursing and Midwifery, East Africa (SONAM EA), provides a full circle perspective on the University's educational approach.",
